name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-postassessment-q10_2026-pilot_2026'

question 'An AI recommendation system suggests news articles to a user based on articles they have clicked before. Over time, the user only sees articles that match their existing views. What concept does this BEST illustrate?'

wrong 'Data privacy violation, because the AI is tracking the user\'s behavior without permission.'
right 'How predictive AI systems can limit perspectives by reinforcing existing patterns rather than exposing users to a broader range of ideas.'
wrong 'Responsible co-creation, because the user and AI are working together to curate a personalized news feed.'
wrong 'Beneficial AI, because the user is getting exactly the content they want.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

